{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_inside_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_inside_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Secret Mission",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_inside_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5e864ed087e490fd3b9c3fe4c9bb97d07ac28a008ff11b12cb8328b1a87af2c4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "The paperwork's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Good work, rookie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Just doing my job. How's the old man doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "(Shakes head)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "There's nothing more the doctors can do for him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Which is to say..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "What's our job now? Executing the citizen's will in our capacity as executors?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Of course. It's our most important duty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Speaking of wills... Richele! Attention!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Y-Yes, ma'am!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "That's more like it. Look alive when you're working!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "I know it's your first mission and I don't want to put unnecessary pressure on you. However..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "This is a secret mission, Richele."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "A secret mission?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Yes. Take this."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The veteran executor takes out a sealed envelope, then tears a page out of her notebook and writes an address on it.\nThen she solemnly gives the envelope and the note to the rookie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Time is of the essence. Deliver this document to this address today. You'll need to leave immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "There will be someone there to receive it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "This is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "I can't tell you. Discretion is crucial for an executor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "But I can tell you that this is an important mission. The contents of the document could throw all of Laterano into chaos."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Throw all of Laterano into chaos..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Seriously?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "But I'm new on the job. Is this really a task I should be entrusted with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Isn't it more suited to a veteran, like you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Unfortunately, I have other urgent matters to attend to. You're the only one I can count on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "You passed the Notarial Hall's entrance exam. You've proven your mettle. Now it's time to show it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Is this how promotion exams work in the Notarial Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Promotion exam?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Er, well, yes! Complete this mission, and you'll be a proper Executor!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Okay..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I guess I'll set out now, if you put it that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Take care!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I will... try..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Good luck, rookie."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(This address is in the outskirts.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(The fastest way would be to go straight down this street and just keep going.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Before that, though...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "Did you know? There's a new shop in Pagus Stevonus. They say it sells the best donuts in town!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "I got in line in the morning and bought two. Try it out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laid-Back Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "text": "Ah, I've tried it before. It's not bad, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "But what? Are you going to keep me guessing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laid-Back Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "text": "Old Darian's donuts are the best. Even better than the new shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laid-Back Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "text": "I tried it once, and I could never forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "Really? I don't believe you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "Hey, man, try this donut! I guarantee it's the best you've ever had."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Who? Me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Sorry, I'm in a hurry. Ask someone else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laid-Back Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "text": "Hey! Wait up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "It won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The executor-in-training's hand moves instinctively, but he drops it back down.\nRichele face twitches a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Sorry, I really am in a hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "Wait...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "(Damn, he's fast!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laid-Back Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "text": "(After him! Don't let him get away!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "*pant*...*pant*...."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "I... I'm out of breath... where did he go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laid-Back Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "text": "No idea... he can run..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "I told you that wouldn't work... getting close to him while pretending to chat like that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chatting Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_367_1",
      "text": "We should have stopped him and taken it by force!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laid-Back Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "text": "Now's not the time for that! I... I've notified the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laid-Back Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "text": "After him!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "So they were after me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Or, to be more specific, what I'm carrying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "The only thing I can think of is this confidential document."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I expected something, but not so soon... how did they know who I was and where I was?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "It sounds like there are others..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(...! Who is it this time?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pontifica Cohors Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_371_1",
      "text": "Excuse me, Senior."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pontifica Cohors Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_371_1",
      "text": "Someone just reported a robbery around here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pontifica Cohors Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_371_1",
      "text": "Did you see anyone suspicious?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "No idea, I'm just passing by."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Is it a coincidence that he's standing in my way?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pontifica Cohors Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_371_1",
      "text": "As the only potential witness right now, I must ask you to cooperate..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Sorry, I'm in a hurry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pontifica Cohors Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_371_1",
      "text": "Wait!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cleric",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "Excuse me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cleric",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "Is something troubling you? Is there anything I can help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Another one.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Well... the situation right now is kind of troubling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Sorry, but I really have to be going."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pontifica Cohors Member?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "Hold it right there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cleric?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "We can't let you go."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Er... what do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cleric?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "No need to play dumb. You know what we're after."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cleric?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "Hand it over!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Well, well, well... what do we have here?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(On the other hand, I don't sense any real hostility in their expression. What is going on with this mission?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Well, it's my first ever job..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I can't screw it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pontifica Cohors Member?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "Do we do it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pontifica Cohors Member?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "Let's see what a Notarial Hall Executor's gun is like."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Could we avoid causing so much commotion in the middle of town?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Bare hands will do."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "I've reviewed your Pontifica Cohors record."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "You've proven to be an outstanding soldier."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Gratias."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "Are you satisfied with being just that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "You've done your job well, but one soldier more or less makes no difference to Laterano."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "We didn't bring you back from that Siracusan town because we wanted a soldier."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "What do you think of Laterano?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "It... it's a fine place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Much better than I expected, in fact. Not just the prosperity... but also a certain order that permeates everyone's lives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "Our Commandments?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Sometimes people want to blow up decorations on the streets, and people like to watch it, but that's not such a bad thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "What I mean is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Not the kind of bad thing where people get hurt, people die, and even those who aren't hurt or dead see their lives destroyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I like this place."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Okay, now I should be fine.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(I can stuff someone into a trash bin, right? As long as they're alive, right? Yeah, I'm sure that's cool...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Secret mission, robbers in the middle of the street... is that what life in Laterano is like?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Wow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(First mission ever, and it's a hot mess...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Maybe I could get a transfer back to the Pontifica Cohors.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Get the stuff to the destination, and then... hm?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Another one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "S-Stop right there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "You shall not pass... er, well, just stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Hand it over!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Hm?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(No sign of professional training. Not what you would expect from someone trying to rob an executor.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Is this a disguise in itself? Something doesn't feel right...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Pardon me, but what do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "The envelope in your hands!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "This one? I'm afraid I can't assent to handing it over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "It's my job, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Well, I can't back off either..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "If you won't hand it over, then I'll have to take it by force!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Hey! Violence is bad!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Argh... let go of me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I'm afraid I can't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Your form was messy. Your footwork was poor, and the delivery was sloppy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I thought self-defense was part of compulsory Lateran education. How did you graduate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "I passed the class! It's not like I'm working any dangerous jobs..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Let me go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Not working any dangerous jobs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I would say trying to rob an executor is plenty dangerous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "How about this: You tell me who sent you, and who else is involved, and I let you go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "I-I can't!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "I can't tell you. You don't know what you're dealing with..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I heard it was something that could 'throw all Laterano into chaos.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Some sort of weapon blueprint?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "You could say that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Anyway, I'm not talking! Don't even bother!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "You're right. This is what sets Laterano apart from the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "You said Laterano was special. What about yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I'm Sankta... so I guess I'm Lateran?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "That's not enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "Let's go to the Notarial Hall. I'll write you a letter of recommendation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "Be more than a spectator. Experience the life of a true Lateran yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "The life of a true Lateran..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "text": "I think you'll like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I've already been delayed too long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Things would be much easier if we weren't in Laterano... I'm not sure I like all this complicated stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Wh-What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "What I mean is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The trainee executor draws the gun from his waist and regretfully presses it against the youth's forehead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "It's such a beautiful day. I didn't want to have to do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Hello, this is the Notarial Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "The commission? Our executor is on it. It will be done today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "...Complications?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Understood. I will deal with it immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "No worries. Richele may be a rookie, and he has much to learn, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "I trust him. He'll complete the mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "...I, I'm alive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Whoa! It's gonna fall!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "H-He shot through the pillar? That's crazy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "He almost broke my arm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Hey, it's me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Sorry, I couldn't stop him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "I told you, how was I supposed to stop an Executor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Youth",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "text": "Well, I think we worked hard enough to make Old Darian happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Whew, almost didn't hold back...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(This is Laterano. I have to do things the Lateran way.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Phew...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(Almost there.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Salve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "(There's no one else here. There's no mistake, right?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Are you the recipient of this will?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yes, I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Thank you for delivering it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Just doing my job."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "This is the envelope I was asked to deliver."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Are you not curious what's inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I heard it's important."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yes, yes. Very important and precious..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Is it really something I should know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The value of something doesn't lie in the number of people who know it or possess it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'll read it out once everyone is here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "You're reading it in public?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hehe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Go ahead, open it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Are you sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "One egg, three tablespoons of sugar, yeast..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "One cup of flour, two tablespoons of maple syrup..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "This is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "A donut recipe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yes. A nice one, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "This is what my husband gave me when he proposed to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "My family and friends chased him all the way. You should have seen him when he finally made it to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Your husband was the decedent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Nods)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We didn't have any children. Not that it was ever a problem. We were happy together, the two of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But we didn't want the recipe to be lost once we're gone from Laterano."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Was there a need to hide it from the executor too, though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "So, those people who tried to stop me were all part of the plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Consider it an old man's last little game."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'm sure he thought I didn't know and wanted to give me a surprise, so that the recipe could be passed on to the next generation over the sound of cheering..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Here, have a donut."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Old Lady",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'm sure you'll like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "How was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Sorry I couldn't tell you the truth. That was part of the client's will."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I still don't understand..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "Why do Laterans do this sort of thing, even though it's completely unnecessary?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "You said you liked sweet stuff, just like pretty much everyone else in Laterano."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "The old man overheard you saying it, which was why he asked for you to deliver the recipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "It would be even better if you learned it and made those donuts regularly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "That's how Laterans are. And you can expect more of this, if you stay on the job."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Not happy about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "On the contrary..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "text": "I love it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Excellent!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Notarial Hall Official",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "Congratulations on a job well done, rookie!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
